  message: "Decided by WI-borib's sweep (2026-10-30, pinned a17367f254, rust-analyzer 1.94.0; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/borib_consumer_agreement_10302026/vosop/FINDINGS.md). Live 92/17/8 vs harness 93/19/7 on calls/in-repo, every edge read:\n(a) STAGE: the survey dedups with remove_self_loops=True (cli.py:13177), the harness without it -- 3 tree-sitter self-loops (error.rs:105, :109, test.rs:37) count rust-only in the harness only. Remedy: the harness runs the flag (93/16/7).\n(b) DEFECT, not a stage: serve.rs:287 parse_configs binds config/mod.rs under walk order and the test helper src/test/test.rs under the survey's sorted FileIndex order -- filed WI-lirik. 93-1 / 16+1 / 7+1 = 92/17/8.\ncalls/external +11 and imports 0/16/0, 0/111/0 live-only: the survey's FILE nodes (module-level calls and every use's src); the harness makes none -- stated in 0019's Reading as the scope of its edge rows. references now agree (270/270); the committed 0019 still said 269 because its guard never checked edge rows -- the guard now does."  # f63e
