  message: "Fixed in PR #1970 (e7fbd56d75). Acceptance (1) every differing row's stage named, re-measured live at rust-analyzer 1.94.0 on a copy of the recorded crate: calls/in-repo 93/19/7 -> 92/17/8 is the survey's remove_self_loops dedup (3 false self-bindings) plus an order-dependent Rust binding at serve.rs:287 (a defect, filed WI-lirik); calls/external +11 and every imports row are the survey's file nodes. (2) the harness now runs the self-loop dedup (93/16/7) and 0019's Reading states that the file-node and file-order stages bound its edge rows. Re-run on merged dev: test_recorded_fixtures.py 20 passed; 0019 reads calls/in-repo 93/16/7, references 270; the table guard now checks every pairing and edge row (mutation-checked both)."  # e3b8
